OL,3,GNEWSAHeadstone installed for last woman
OL,4,Aexecuted in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA headstone for Ruth Ellis, the last
OL,7,Fwoman to be executed in the UK, has
OL,8,Fbeen installed after a special request
OL,9,Ffrom her eldest grandson.
OL,11,FScott Walker said he was determined to
OL,12,Fhave something "poignant and punchy" in
OL,13,Fplace at St Mary's Cemetery in
OL,14,FAmersham, Buckinghamshire, to mark what
OL,15,Fwould have been his late grandmother's
OL,16,F100th birthday.
OL,18,FEllis was hanged at London's Holloway
OL,19,FPrison in 1955 at the age of 28 after
OL,20,Fbeing convicted of murdering her lover,
OL,21,FDavid Blakely. She had been interred in
OL,22,Fan unmarked grave.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
